{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier\/init()"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier\/body(content:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier\/ViewModifier-Implementations"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier"}],"symbolKind":"struct","role":"symbol","title":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents24OUDSLegacyLayoutModifierV","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","kind":"identifier"}]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifier"},{"text":" to manage an edge case about Liquid Glass configuration of Apple OS and Xcode versions.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 27 for iOS 27, Liquid Glass is forced by the system and considered as enabled by OUDS."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 26 for iOS 26, the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" flag is read and OUDS considers wether or not Liquid Glass is enabled."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 26 for iOS 18 and lower, Liquid Glass is considered as unavailable, disabled."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The edge case is when the OS version is 27, the flag "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" stils exists but the app is compiled with Xcode 26."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This case is extreme: the system does not force Liquid Glass, the flag is here, and OUDS cannot only rely on the OS version."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thus, this "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier"},{"type":"text","text":"  will define an environment value saying any legacy layout things (appearances, selector, divider) must be displayed."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"**You must use this "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifier"},{"type":"text","text":" with care, and only if you are using Xcode 26 and  "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" to YES **."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Prefer build with Xcode 27 without the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"  flag."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["  OUDSTabBar(selectedTab: ..., count: ...) { ... )","    .modifier(OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier())"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Note: You should use this view modifier in your root view because the flag it defines in deeper levels is used for all navigations components like bars","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"3.0.0","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Since"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslegacylayoutmodifier"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://OUDSComponents/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP","type":"unresolvable","title":"SwiftUICore.ViewModifier"},"doc://OUDSComponents/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.SendableMetatype"},"doc://OUDSComponents/s8SendableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Sendable"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"code":"ViewModifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to manage an edge case about Liquid Glass configuration of Apple OS and Xcode versions."}],"title":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslegacylayoutmodifier","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSLegacyLayo